[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-005
METHOD: Demonstration
TITLE: voetbal.nl options in the web admin
STATEMENT: >>>
Open the feed settings of a voetbal.nl feed in the profile page and in the user admin page: the home/away switch, the own team field and the 'Scheidsrechter compact' switch are shown; the 'Club' field appears only while that switch is on, prefilled from the own team; saving them changes the titles. For another feed the options are not shown.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Not automated: browser UI. Not yet performed.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-044
  ROLE: Verifies

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-008
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Web admin loads the current scripts after an update
STATEMENT: >>>
Pages load local scripts and stylesheets with a content hash in the URL, so after an update a browser cannot keep using a cached copy of the old feed dialog.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_web_pages.py: test_scripts_are_versioned_by_content
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Added after the options were missing in the user admin page: that page loaded admin_user_detail.js without a version and the browser kept the cached pre-0.7.4 script.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-044
  ROLE: Verifies

